{"id":"level-up-2026-09-21","name":"2026-09-21 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s151","en":"The community hopes to reclaim the abandoned railway yard as parkland.","zh":"社区希望把废弃铁路货场重新开发成公园。","note":"reclaim · 纠正； 要求归还， 收回； 开垦 · reclaim land","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s152","en":"My brother is allergic to cats, so we keep fish.","zh":"我弟弟对猫过敏，所以我们养鱼。","note":"allergic · 过敏的， 变态反应的， 变应性的 · allergic to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s153","en":"The teacher explained why students must never cheat in exams.","zh":"老师解释了学生为什么绝不能考试作弊。","note":"cheat · 欺骗；作弊；欺骗； 骗子 · cheat in an exam","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s154","en":"I disable notifications on my phone while preparing lectures.","zh":"备课时，我会关闭手机通知。","note":"disable · 使丧失能力， 使伤残； 使不能正常运转， 使无效 · disable notifications","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s155","en":"The new bridge will undoubtedly improve access to the island.","zh":"新桥无疑将改善通往该岛的交通条件。","note":"undoubtedly · 毋庸置疑地， 确凿地 · undoubtedly important","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s156","en":"The documentary's images of polluted beaches will horrify many viewers.","zh":"纪录片中海滩受污染的画面会让许多观众震惊。","note":"horrify · 使恐惧， 使惊骇； 使震惊； 使感到厌恶 · horrify an audience","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s157","en":"She opened her presentation with an amusing anecdote about school.","zh":"她用一个有趣的校园小故事开始了演讲。","note":"anecdote · 短故事； 趣闻， 轶事 · a personal anecdote","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s158","en":"Buying another camera seemed an unnecessary extravagance on our budget.","zh":"按我们的预算，再买一台相机似乎是不必要的奢侈。","note":"extravagance · 奢侈， 挥霍； 放肆的言行 · an unnecessary extravagance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s159","en":"In the novel, a journalist tries to infiltrate a secret network.","zh":"小说中，一名记者试图潜入一个秘密组织网络。","note":"infiltrate · 悄悄进入， 潜入； 渗入， 渗透 · infiltrate a network","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s160","en":"The proposal received a hostile reception at the residents' meeting.","zh":"这项提案在居民会议上遭到强烈反对。","note":"hostile · 敌方的； 不友善的； 不利的 · a hostile reception","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s161","en":"The cold winter increased demand for fuel across the region.","zh":"寒冷的冬季使整个地区的燃料需求增加。","note":"fuel · 给…加燃料；燃料 · fuel demand","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s162","en":"The guide helped us identify the island's distinctive native flora.","zh":"导游帮助我们辨认该岛独特的本土植物。","note":"flora · 一切植物， 植物群 · native flora","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s163","en":"The children used a telescope to observe distant celestial bodies.","zh":"孩子们用望远镜观察遥远的天体。","note":"celestial · 天体的， 天上的 · celestial bodies","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s164","en":"The kitten tried to crawl under the closed garden gate.","zh":"小猫试图从关着的花园门下面爬过去。","note":"crawl · 爬，爬行；缓慢行进；缓慢的行进； 自由泳 · crawl under","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s165","en":"The two reports were identical except for their publication dates.","zh":"除了出版日期外，两份报告完全相同。","note":"identical · 完全相同的， 同一的 · virtually identical","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s166","en":"Rural internet speeds still lag behind those in major cities.","zh":"农村的网速仍落后于大城市。","note":"lag · 走得慢；落后；间隔； 滞后 · lag behind","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s167","en":"The council announced an ambitious plan to restore the river.","zh":"市政委员会宣布了一项雄心勃勃的河流修复计划。","note":"ambitious · 有抱负的， 有雄心的， 有野心的 · an ambitious plan","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s168","en":"The library provides quiet rooms for students doing academic research.","zh":"图书馆为开展学术研究的学生提供安静的房间。","note":"academic · 学院的；学术的；不切实际的；学者； 大学教师 · academic research","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s169","en":"Divers photographed colourful fish swimming above the coral reef.","zh":"潜水员拍摄了在珊瑚礁上方游动的彩色鱼群。","note":"coral · 珊瑚色的， 红色的；珊瑚；珊瑚虫 · a coral reef","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s170","en":"The heating system will not function properly without regular maintenance.","zh":"如果不定期维护，供暖系统就无法正常运转。","note":"function · 运行，起作用；功能； 职责， 作用； 函数 · function properly","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s171","en":"The seminar examined community responses to juvenile delinquency.","zh":"研讨会研究了社区应对青少年违法行为的方式。","note":"delinquency · 失职； 行为不良 · juvenile delinquency","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s172","en":"The researchers selected a representative sample from each district.","zh":"研究人员从每个地区选取了具有代表性的样本。","note":"representative · 典型的， 有代表性的；代表，代理人 · a representative sample","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s173","en":"The map lists the latitude and longitude of each station.","zh":"地图列出了每个站点的纬度和经度。","note":"longitude · 经度， 经线 · latitude and longitude","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s174","en":"Lax supervision allowed minor problems to continue for several months.","zh":"监管松懈让一些小问题持续了数月。","note":"lax · 懒散的； 松弛的， 不严格的， 马虎的 · lax supervision","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s175","en":"The table allows a direct comparison between the two models.","zh":"这张表让人能直接比较这两款型号。","note":"comparison · 比较， 对比， 对照； 比喻， 比拟 · a direct comparison","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s176","en":"We watched the chicks hatch during our visit to the farm.","zh":"参观农场时，我们看到了小鸡孵化。","note":"hatch · 孵出，孵化；策划；开口； 舱门 · hatch an egg","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s177","en":"I beg your pardon; I did not hear the room number.","zh":"请再说一遍，我没有听清房间号。","note":"pardon · 请重复一遍，请再说一遍〔没听清对方的话希望重复一遍时的用语〕；赦免；赦免令，赦免状 · beg your pardon","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s178","en":"The guide described the elephant as a large herbivore.","zh":"导游将大象描述为一种大型食草动物。","note":"herbivore · 食草动物 · a large herbivore","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s179","en":"Their first overnight camping trip felt like a real adventure.","zh":"第一次过夜露营对他们来说像是一场真正的冒险。","note":"adventure · 冒险， 冒险活动； 异乎寻常的经历， 奇遇 · a sense of adventure","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s180","en":"Successive generations of the family have worked in this bakery.","zh":"这家人连续几代都在这间面包店工作。","note":"successive · 连续的 · successive generations","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s181","en":"The secondhand bicycle is still in remarkably good condition.","zh":"这辆二手自行车的状况仍然出奇地好。","note":"condition · 状况，状态；；训练； 使适应， 使习惯于； 对…有重要影响 · in good condition","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s182","en":"After walking uphill for an hour, we were extremely thirsty.","zh":"上坡走了一个小时后，我们渴极了。","note":"thirsty · 口渴的； 饥渴的 · feel thirsty","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s183","en":"The opening ceremony will take place in the central square.","zh":"开幕式将在中心广场举行。","note":"ceremony · 典礼； 仪式 · an opening ceremony","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s184","en":"Regular conversation practice helped me improve my listening skills.","zh":"经常练习对话帮助我提高了听力。","note":"improve · 改善， 改进 · improve one's skills","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s185","en":"She felt an obligation to return the money she found.","zh":"她觉得自己有责任归还捡到的钱。","note":"obligation · 义务， 职责， 责任 · a moral obligation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s186","en":"Teachers can learn from students, and vice versa.","zh":"老师可以向学生学习，反过来也一样。","note":"vice versa · 反过来也是如此，反之亦然 · vice versa","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s187","en":"A hawk circled above the field before landing on a fence.","zh":"一只鹰在田野上空盘旋，然后落在围栏上。","note":"hawk · 鹰， 隼 · a soaring hawk","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s188","en":"Snow is a rarity in this warm coastal city.","zh":"雪在这座温暖的海滨城市很少见。","note":"rarity · 稀有； 稀有的事物 · a relative rarity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s189","en":"The choir performed patriotic songs at the national celebration.","zh":"合唱团在全国庆典上演唱了爱国歌曲。","note":"patriotic · 爱国的， 有爱国心的； 显示出爱国精神的 · patriotic songs","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s190","en":"A public lavatory is located near the bus station entrance.","zh":"公交车站入口附近有一处公共厕所。","note":"lavatory · 盥洗室， 厕所 · a public lavatory","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s191","en":"Workers painted the building's exterior while its offices remained open.","zh":"办公室照常开放时，工人粉刷了这栋楼的外墙。","note":"exterior · 外部的，外表的；外部， 外表 · the building's exterior","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s192","en":"The committee faced public censure for ignoring residents' complaints.","zh":"委员会因无视居民投诉而受到公开谴责。","note":"censure · 指责， 谴责， 责难 · public censure","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s193","en":"Store the biscuits in an airtight container to keep them crisp.","zh":"把饼干放在密闭容器中，保持其酥脆。","note":"airtight · 密闭的； 无懈可击的 · an airtight container","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s194","en":"The artist demonstrated a simple technique for painting reflected light.","zh":"艺术家演示了一种绘制反射光的简单技法。","note":"technique · 技巧， 技艺； 技术， 技能 · a painting technique","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s195","en":"The secretary used shorthand to record the speaker's words quickly.","zh":"秘书用速记快速记录了演讲者的话。","note":"shorthand · 速记法； 速记 · take shorthand","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s196","en":"The documentary follows birds raised in captivity before their release.","zh":"纪录片跟拍了放归前在人工圈养环境中长大的鸟。","note":"captivity · 囚禁， 拘留 · in captivity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-21:s197","en":"We stopped several times to photograph the mountain scenery.","zh":"我们停下了好几次，拍摄山间风景。","note":"scenery · 舞台布景； 风景， 景色 · beautiful scenery","recordings":[]},{"id":"c